 y='135' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>3</text><text x='200' y='135' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>4</text><text x='250' y='135' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>5</text><text x='300' y='135' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>6</text><text x='350' y='135' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>7</text><text x='50' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>8</text><text x='100' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>9</text><text x='150' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>10</text><text x='200' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>11</text><text x='250' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>12</text><text x='300' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>13</text><text x='350' y='175' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>14</text><text x='50' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>15</text><text x='100' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>16</text><text x='150' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>17</text><text x='200' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>18</text><text x='250' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>19</text><text x='300' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>20</text><text x='350' y='215' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>21</text><text x='50' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>22</text><text x='100' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>23</text><text x='150' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>24</text><text x='200' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>25</text><text x='250' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>26</text><text x='300' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>27</text><text x='350' y='255' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>28</text><text x='50' y='295' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>29</text><text x='100' y='295' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>30</text><text x='150' y='295' text-anchor='middle' font-family='sans-serif' font-size='16' fill='currentColor'>31</text></svg></div><br><div style='font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;'>Five years ago, Obi was 5 times younger than his dad. In 10 years' time, Obi's dad will be twice as old as Obi. How old is Obi now?</div>",
      "options": [
        "10 years old",
        "12 years old",
        "15 years old",
        "8 years old"
      ],
      "correctAnswer": 0,
      "explanation": "Let Obi's current age be <b>x</b> and his dad's current age be <b>y</b>.<br><br><b>Step 1: Translate the first sentence into an equation</b><br>Five years ago, Obi was (x − 5) and his dad was (y − 5).<br>At that time, the dad was 5 times older than Obi:<br>y − 5 = 5(x − 5)<br>y − 5 = 5x − 25<br><b>y = 5x − 20</b>  (Equation 1)<br><br><b>Step 2: Translate the second sentence into an equation</b><br>In 10 years' time, Obi will be (x + 10) and his dad will be (y + 10).<br>At that time, the dad will be twice as old as Obi:<br>y + 10 = 2(x + 10)<br>y + 10 = 2x + 20<br><b>y = 2x + 10</b>  (Equation 2)<br><br><b>Step 3: Solve the simultaneous equations</b><br>Since both equations equal y, we can set them equal to each other:<br>5x − 20 = 2x + 10<br>5x − 2x = 10 + 20<br>3x = 30<br><b>x = 10</b><br><br>So, Obi is currently <b>10 years old</b>. (His dad is currently y = 2(10) + 10 = 30 years old).<br><br>• Option B (12) is a trap for calculation errors.<br>• Option C (15) is a trap for those who misread the word 'younger' and set up the equation incorrectly.<br>• Option D (8) is a trap for those who solve for the dad's age (y=30) and subtract 22, or make sign errors.",
      "difficulty": "easy",
      "points": 1
    }
